     "en": "Water's coming out in the bathroom. We have to call a plumber."
    },
    {
     "quien": "Deniz",
     "tr": "Ev yöneticisine haber verdin mi?",
     "es": "¿Avisaste al administrador del piso?",
     "en": "Did you tell the floor manager?"
    },
    {
     "quien": "Can",
     "tr": "Evet, aradım. Acil yardım gönderecek.",
     "es": "Sí, llamé. Enviará ayuda urgente.",
     "en": "Yeah, I called. He'll send urgent help."
    },
    {
     "quien": "Deniz",
     "tr": "O gelene kadar suyu kapatalım.",
     "es": "Cerremos el agua hasta que llegue.",
     "en": "We'll close the water until it gets here."
    }
   ]
